{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日発売のヤングマガジンさんに載せて頂いてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフショット"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4QCKR3GEDCTZSBVEDEY31","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4QDJBN6834PS3PWXAJRH7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りさとのこの写真とっても好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4QEJFT3JPNB9STEG26576","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お庭にプールとか。やばい。泳ぎたかった〜(๑¯ω¯๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非お手に取ってくださーい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前に、道を歩いていたら学校の前を通って。そこに警備員さんがいて帰りにまた通ったら、学生さんと仲良く話してて、なんか良いなって思ったので。書いてみましたー!(｢・ω・)｢"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"身長最近はかったら、167.5センチに伸びてた。どこまで伸びるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リサとおそろい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4QFH85N1AYS4QDQVK4YQR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リサが歩いてる時にかかとの部分が、きゅっと潰れるのを見るのが好きです(๑¯ω¯๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4QGKM3MGZ0EN9AGJ3ZMRV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばーぁーーい"}],"source":"archive"}